The generated CUDA code:
```cpp
extern "C" __global__ void buggy_kernel_kernel(float* __restrict__ x, int num_tokens);
extern "C" __global__ void __launch_bounds__(32, 1) buggy_kernel_kernel(float* __restrict__ x, int num_tokens) {
  int read = 0;
  read = ((int)x[((int64_t)((int)blockIdx.x))]);
